or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Sussex County came in under 90% of normal in September to October in 37 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 that middle fell to 60% of normal in August to September and 51% in November to December. So far in 2026 it shows 46% for March to April and 47% for April to May. Grid 22420 had its driest year in 1968 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
